loom ledger=reds pin_bytes_before=45067 pin_bytes_after=40622 bound=40960 rows_folded=2
file tools/fixtures/r/reds_ledger_monotone_scan.sh numbers_double_bound reported rather than gated, and the header says which guard holds the teeth and why this one cannot
file tools/gen/chapter/reds_ledger_monotone_witness.rish the second-double leg proving the ceiling lifted rather than raised, and a leg running the named guard on a planted local double
file construction/REDS.md the surviving row, booked after a fetch and folded the same hour to hold the pin under bound
file construction/archive/REDS-a-guard-that-could-not-say-what-it-knew-rows-598.md the shelf, its header recording the row that withdrew and to whom
file construction/ITINERARY.md this lap's account, the elder shelved, the parked-lap interlock surfaced as a word
file construction/archive/20260907-232511_itinerary-landed-accounts.md the elder Bakery account, shelved whole
